  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">FORETS INCLUSIVES ET DURABLES AU MAROC - NIP 2024</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">&lt;p class=&quot;ql-align-justify&quot;&gt;The Project will contribute to support the implementation of the Moroccan Forest Strategy by financing investments and providing technical assistance. It will involve funding Nature Based Solutions through&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p class=&quot;ql-align-justify&quot;&gt;(1) improving sustainable management practices in climate-smart agriculture, biodiversity and forest management, and&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p class=&quot;ql-align-justify&quot;&gt;(2) building the capacity of sector institutions and public/private operators to enable sustainable investments in agriculture, biodiversity and forestry. It is expected that such activities will lead to an increased protection of ecosystems, sustainable use of natural resources and restoration of biodiversity, as well as the promotion of ecosystem services that benefit women and men, as well as more indirect and inclusive employment and income opportunities.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p class=&quot;ql-align-justify&quot;&gt;The AfDB will support ANEF in parallel with EIB with an investment loan of EUR 84m to the Kingdom of Morocco to finance different infrastructure and transversal topics of the Project.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p class=&quot;ql-align-justify&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;&lt;em&gt;2.1Objectives&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p class=&quot;ql-align-justify&quot;&gt;The Project&#xbf;s general objectives are:&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p class=&quot;ql-align-justify&quot;&gt;(i)to prevent and/or reduce environmental degradation, and&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p class=&quot;ql-align-justify&quot;&gt;(ii)to increase green and inclusive employment.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p class=&quot;ql-align-justify&quot;&gt;By including environmental externalities in the costs and revenues for society as a whole, the project helps to mitigate the under-provision of these environmental public goods.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p class=&quot;ql-align-justify&quot;&gt;The Project&#xbf;s outcomes and outputs are summarized in the Log Framework in Section B (&lt;em&gt;General Background on the Project supported by the Action&lt;/em&gt;), clause 2.5 &lt;em&gt;(Expected Results and related Indicators)&lt;/em&gt; of Annex 1 &lt;em&gt;(Description of the Action)&lt;/em&gt;.&lt;/p&gt;</narrative>
  </description>
